WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Chun-Li enters Serenity Stream beside Ken.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.800
The heavy-punch stance follow-up hits Ken overhead.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.400
OD Spinning Bird Kick launches Ken.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.400
Light Spinning Bird Kick juggles Ken after the OD launch.

5
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.550
Ken recovers after the light SBK follow-up.
